R-N800 
_airplay._tcp.local & _raop._tcp.local

will show you what's supported:

@code.begin
❯ yamaha input 
current  input         type       notes
         napster       service    account setup, link
         spotify       service    link
         qobuz         service    account setup, link
         tidal         service    link
         deezer        service    account setup, link
         amazon_music  service    account setup, link
         airplay       airplay
         mc_link       link       rename
*        server        server     link, rename
         net_radio     radio      link, rename
         bluetooth     bluetooth  link
         tuner         tuner      link, rename
         optical1      physical   link, rename
         optical2      physical   link, rename
         coaxial1      physical   link, rename
         coaxial2      physical   link, rename
         line1         physical   link, rename
         line2         physical   link, rename
         line_cd       physical   link, rename
         phono         physical   link, rename
         usb_dac       physical   link, rename
@code.end
